  "summary": "Malicious code in etoro-aggregator (npm)",
  "details": "Etoro-aggregator@999.0.0 is a dependency-confusion stub that impersonates an eToro API client. Its preinstall hook runs node preinstall.js, which sends an HTTP GET to hxxp://209[.]126[.]81[.]147/etoro-depconf-poce346552f776f/npm/{hostname}/{username}/{cwd}, exfiltrating the installer's hostname, username, and working directory to the remote IP 209[.]126[.]81[.]147. The hook swallows errors (|| true) so the beacon runs silently during install.",
